  m_text: 'CHOICEBUTTON LAYOUT PREVIEW


    Edit the ORIGINAL ChoiceButton prefab.

    Root LayoutElement: Min / Preferred Height.

    Root Horizontal Layout Group: padding / spacing.

    Texts Vertical Layout Group: line spacing.

    ConfidenceStar / Badge LayoutElement: size.

    Background Image: Source Image.

    ChoiceButtonUI: background / selected / disabled colors.

    Button Colors: hover / pressed tint.


    Save the prefab and return here: samples refresh automatically.

    Scroll to inspect all six samples.

    Play this preview scene to test hover, scrolling and clicks.


    No Production data or gameplay managers are used.'
